<title>UK: Norways Gullfaks crude to load 22 cargoes in Feb.</title>
<headline>Norways Gullfaks crude to load 22 cargoes in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Gullfaks crude system is scheduled to load 22 standard 850,000 barrel cargoes in February, two more than the 20 expected to load in January, traders said.</p>
<p>The number of cargoes in February includes two cargoes loading across the end of the month between February 27 and March 3, they said.</p>
</text>
